          "en": "Concerning laws and decrees:\n1. Important laws and decrees that are to be announced to the people of the whole country shall, after being approved by the Government Administration Council and delivered to the Xinhua News Agency for release, be published by the People's Daily on the appropriate pages according to their content and importance; where they are required to be published on a specified date, the Secretary's Office of the Government Administration Council shall so indicate.\n2. Less important laws and decrees may, where the space of the People's Daily is congested, be published in a supplement; where a time limit for publication is indicated, they must be published within that time limit; where no time limit is indicated, they must be published within one week from the date of receipt of the manuscript.\n3. Laws and decrees that relate only to a part of the people or a part of the regions and are not of significance for general information shall, unless the Government Administration Council designates the Xinhua News Agency to notify the newspapers in the places concerned to publish them in full, be published by the People's Daily in a supplement or in summary."
