          "en": "Concerning reports:\n1. Important reports that the Government Administration Council designates for publication in the People's Daily shall be carried by the People's Daily on the appropriate pages according to their content, nature and importance, or carried in a supplement. Where a time limit is specified, they shall be published within that time limit.\n2. Ordinary work summary reports and the like may be published by the People's Daily in the form of news items written in summary or converted into articles; however, where the issuing organ so requests in view of the needs of its work, they may also be published in full by the People's Daily in a supplement."
